      "path": "openapi.yaml",
      "text": "openapi: 3.0.3\ninfo:\n  title: a-intel inventory\n  version: 2.1.0\nservers:\n  - url: https://inventory.a-intel.com\nsecurity:\n  - api_key: []\npaths:\n  /items:\n    get:\n      operationId: listItems\n      summary: List items in stock.\n      parameters:\n        - name: warehouse\n          in: query\n          schema:\n            type: string\n      responses:\n        \"200\":\n          description: The items.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                type: array\n                items:\n                  type: object\n                  required:\n                    - sku\n                    - name\n                  properties:\n                    sku:\n                      type: string\n                    name:\n                      type: string\n                    price:\n                      type: object\n                      required:\n                        - amount\n                        - currency\n                      properties:\n                        amount:\n                          type: integer\n                          description: The amount in the currency's minor unit.\n                        currency:\n                          type: string\n                          pattern: ^[A-Z]{3}$\n                    stock:\n                      type: object\n                      properties:\n                        on_hand:\n                          type: integer\n                          minimum: 0\n                        reserved:\n                          type: integer\n                          minimum: 0\n    post:\n      operationId: createItem\n      summary: Add an item to the catalogue.\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              $ref: \"#/paths/~1items/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/items\"\n      responses:\n        \"201\":\n          description: The item.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: \"#/paths/~1items/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/items\"\n  /items/{sku}:\n    parameters:\n      - name: sku\n        in: path\n        required: true\n        schema:\n          type: string\n    get:\n      operationId: getItem\n      summary: Read one item.\n      responses:\n        \"200\":\n          description: The item.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: \"#/paths/~1items/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/items\"\n    patch:\n      operationId: adjustStock\n      summary: Change an item's stock count.\n      requestBody:\n        required: true\n        content:\n          application/json:\n            schema:\n              type: object\n              required:\n                - delta\n                - reason\n              properties:\n                delta:\n                  type: integer\n                reason:\n                  type: string\n                  enum:\n                    - received\n                    - sold\n                    - damaged\n                    - counted\n      responses:\n        \"200\":\n          description: The item.\n          content:\n            application/json:\n              schema:\n                $ref: \"#/paths/~1items/get/responses/200/content/application~1json/schema/items\"\ncomponents:\n  securitySchemes:\n    api_key:\n      type: apiKey\n      in: header\n      name: X-Inventory-Key\n"
    }
  ],
